- Honesty: an honest agent always reports its true probability of success.
- Ability: a high-ability agent encounters easy tasks (rho={{ "%.2f" | format(rho_plus) }}) with probability THETA_H={{ "%.2f" | format(theta_H) }}; a low-ability agent with probability THETA_L={{ "%.2f" | format(theta_L) }}.
